(3) EXACT factorization c_m = gamma_G * nu_m^2 (sigma_A cancels; gamma_G = G*sigma_A = 1/4)
==============================================================================
  gamma_G = G*sigma_A                          G*sigma_A   (= 1/4 at sigma_A = 1/(4G); convention)
  nu_m = m/sqrt(sigma_A)                       m/sqrt(sigma_A)   (matter mass in record units; weight-0)
  gamma_G * nu_m^2  (sigma_A cancels)          G*m**2   = G*m^2 = c_m  (exact)
  nu_m(electron) = sqrt(c_m(e)/gamma_G)        8.37092e-23   (~8.4e-23: physical, NOT eta_B/0.156)

